<title>THAILAND: Thai July trade deficit narrows to 30 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai July trade deficit narrows to 30 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's July trade deficit narrowed to an estimated 30 billion baht from a revised 35.5 billion in June, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE    July 96    June 96	 July 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     118.0	109.5	   114.4</p>
<p>	  Imports	     148.0	145.0	   151.9</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -30.0	-35.5	   -37.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
